*> A BoundingBox (docs/protocol/36-structures-1 section 6.3): six ints, both ends inclusive. Included at level 15 under an 01 to 10 group, with REPLACING LEADING ==BX-== BY ==prefix==.
       15 BX-X0                BINARY-LONG.
       15 BX-Y0                BINARY-LONG.
       15 BX-Z0                BINARY-LONG.
       15 BX-X1                BINARY-LONG.
       15 BX-Y1                BINARY-LONG.
       15 BX-Z1                BINARY-LONG.
